## Performance Optimization

### File Organization
- Keep LiveView modules in `lib/app_web/live/` directory
- Use `.ex` files for LiveView modules
- Split complex LiveViews into smaller components using `live_component/3`
- Keep templates in separate `.heex` files when they exceed 50 lines

